### 0. Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 1. Register  (paste the PUBLIC key printed by cli/DevKeyGen into "publicKey")
POST http://localhost:8080/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "publicKey": "PASTE_PUBLIC_KEY_HERE"
}

### 2. Login  (copy "token" from the response into the variable below)
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "SecurePass123" }

### 3. Who am I?  (replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:8080/users/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 4. Look up a recipient's public key
GET http://localhost:8080/users/lookup?email=alice@example.com
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 5. My files
GET http://localhost:8080/files/mine
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 6. Logout (the token stops working immediately)
POST http://localhost:8080/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
